@startuml
title Governance - L0 Overview
actor Caller
participant GovernanceTemplate
participant GovernanceExecutor
participant GovernanceEngine
participant "Downstream Invocation" as D
Caller -> GovernanceTemplate : execute(resource, invocation)
GovernanceTemplate -> GovernanceExecutor : execute(context,...)
GovernanceExecutor -> GovernanceEngine : execute(context, policy, invocation)
GovernanceEngine -> D : invoke
D --> GovernanceEngine : result / failure
GovernanceEngine --> GovernanceExecutor
GovernanceExecutor --> Caller : result / mapped exception / fallback
@enduml
